# The IDO 5.3 files a compiler driver runs, by name and SHA-256.
# tools/ido/setup finds each one by name under a source directory, checks it against the
# digest here, refuses anything else, and installs the verified copy into artifacts/ido/.
# This release is kept pinned beside 7.1 so the two can be installed side by side and
# compared. The version configuration names which one the build runs; docs/toolchain.md
# records what separates them.
# These are the Linux recompilations published by the ido-static-recomp project, not SGI's
# original IRIX binaries, which cannot run here.

